flowchart TD
    A[Input Image] --> B[Load & Convert RGB]

    B --> C[Initialize EasyOCR + Draw]

    subgraph OCR
        C --> D[SAHI: Slice Image]
        D --> E[For Each Tile]
        E --> F[EasyOCR: Detect Text]
        F --> G[Collect Global Detections]
    end

    G --> H{Valid Text?}

    H -->|No| I[Skip]
    H -->|Yes| J[Translate with Phi-4]

    J --> K[Erase Original Text]
    K --> L[Load Font]
    L --> M[Draw Translated Text]
    
    M --> N[Save Translated Image]
    M --> O[Save Translations to TXT]

    N --> P[End]
    O --> P

    style A fill:#e6f3ff
    style P fill:#d4edda